        -1895.4089537724801
      ],
      "note": "9rcd is -121.640625..-121.2890625 by 43.9453125..44.12109375. x = (lng - west)/(east - west) * 8192; y = (asinh(tan latN) - asinh(tan lat))/(asinh(tan latN) - asinh(tan latS)) * 8192, then the sign flip. The west edge lands off the raster at x = -3947.43...: real cells are drawn at their full extents, overhang and all. Cross-checked in python to 1e-10.",
      "handDerived": true
    },
